 * regression waiting to happen.
 *
 * fw      proven                                                    source
 * 13.00   devkit                                                   (TBD)
 * 13.xx   retail + devkit                                          WORKING.txt 2026-08-17
 * 13.40   devkit                                                   (TBD)
 * 13.xx   devkit                                                   (TBD)
 * 13.60   devkit                                                   (TBD)
